@startuml NINA-AES_Sequence_CorrectionNINA
' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
'  NINA-AES — Séquence : Correction NINA assistée par IA
'  Bloc A · Acteur principal : Citoyen
'  Auteur : Étudiant UQAR · Avril 2026
' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

title Séquence — Correction NINA avec IA (Bloc A)

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #475569
  ActorBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
  ActorBorderColor #D97706
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF4FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
  FontName Inter
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #ECFDF5
  BorderColor #059669
}

actor "Citoyen" as Citizen #FEF3C7
participant "Portail Web\n(citizen)" as Portal #DBEAFE
participant "API Gateway\n(:3000)" as Gateway #DBEAFE
participant "Identity\nService\n(:3001)" as Identity #E0E7FF
participant "AI Service\n(:3003)" as AI #FEE2E2
participant "SIGAC\n(:3009)" as SIGAC #FCE7F3
participant "Audit\nService\n(:3007)" as Audit #FEF3C7
participant "Notification\nService\n(:3005)" as Notif #DCFCE7
actor "Superviseur" as Sup #FED7AA
participant "Document\nService\n(:3004)" as Doc #E0F2FE

== 1. Soumission de la demande ==

Citizen -> Portal : Saisit nouveau libellé\n(ex. cercle "Sikaso" → "Sikasso")
activate Portal
Portal -> Portal : Validation Zod côté client\n(longueur, caractères autorisés)
Portal -> Gateway : POST /correction-requests\n{ nina, field, proposedValue, evidenceFile }
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Gateway : Vérifie JWT RS256\n(citoyen authentifié OIDC)
Gateway -> Identity : POST /corrections (forwardé + correlationId)
deactivate Portal
activate Identity

== 2. Analyse IA ==

Identity -> AI : POST /score\n{ field, current, proposed, citizen_context }
activate AI
note right of AI
  Pipeline 5 étapes :
  1. Normalisation (NFD, lowercase)
  2. Fuzzy matching (RapidFuzz / Jellyfish)
  3. Embedding spaCy (similarité sémantique)
  4. XGBoost binary classifier
  5. Calibration → score 0-100
end note
AI --> Identity : { score: 92.4, verdict: "HIGH_CONFIDENCE",\n  matches: ["Sikasso ML-03"] }
deactivate AI

== 3. Vérification anti-corruption ==

Identity -> SIGAC : POST /integrity-check\n{ agentId?, citizenId, field, score }
activate SIGAC
SIGAC -> SIGAC : Recalcule score d'intégrité agent\n(Isolation Forest sur historique)
SIGAC --> Identity : { agentScore: 87, suspicious: false }
deactivate SIGAC

== 4. Persistance + audit ==

Identity -> Identity : Crée CorrectionRequest\n(status=UNDER_REVIEW)
Identity -> Audit : Publish AMQP "audit.correction.created"\n{ entityType, entityId, oldValue, newValue, ipAddress }
activate Audit
Audit -> Audit : SHA256(previousHash || JSON)\n→ merkleHash
Audit -> Audit : Sign Ed25519 (clé Vault)
Audit --> Identity : ack
deactivate Audit

Identity --> Gateway : 201 Created\n{ id, status: UNDER_REVIEW, aiScore: 92.4 }
Gateway --> Citizen : Confirmation + n° de suivi
deactivate Gateway

== 5. Notification au superviseur ==

Identity -> Notif : Publish "correction.review_required"\n{ correctionId, supervisorId, priority }
activate Notif
Notif -> Sup : Push + Email + SMS\n"Correction #1234 à examiner (score IA 92)"
deactivate Notif

== 6. Décision superviseur ==

Sup -> Portal : Ouvre l'écran AD-02\n(détail correction + score IA + justificatif)
activate Portal
Portal -> Gateway : PATCH /corrections/:id\n{ status: APPROVED, reviewerNote }
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Identity : PATCH (avec sub Keycloak du superviseur)
activate Identity
Identity -> Identity : Vérifie role=SUPERVISOR\nrégion correspondante
Identity -> Identity : Update CorrectionRequest\n(reviewedBy, decidedAt)
Identity -> Identity : Update Citizen.fieldXxx\n(version++ — optimistic lock)

Identity -> Audit : Publish "audit.correction.approved"
activate Audit
Audit --> Identity : ack
deactivate Audit

== 7. Régénération de la FDI signée ==

Identity -> Doc : POST /fdi/regenerate\n{ citizenId, version }
activate Doc
Doc -> Doc : Génère PDF/A-3\n(Puppeteer + template HBS)
Doc -> Doc : Génère QR code\n→ JWT RS256\n{ nina, name, dob, photoHash, ver, exp }
Doc -> Doc : Stocke MinIO (chiffré SSE-C)\n+ index Elasticsearch
Doc --> Identity : { url: signed-url-15min, hash: sha256 }
deactivate Doc

Identity --> Gateway : 200 OK { fdiUrl }
deactivate Identity
Gateway --> Portal : Réponse OK
deactivate Gateway
deactivate Portal

== 8. Notification au citoyen ==

Identity -> Notif : Publish "correction.approved"\n{ citizenId, channel: preferredLanguage }
activate Notif
Notif -> Citizen : SMS (FR/BM/SNK/FF/TMQ/HAU/MOS/DJE)\n+ Push si app mobile installée\n"Votre NINA a été corrigé. FDI : <url>"
deactivate Notif

note over Citizen, Doc
  ⏱ Latence cible end-to-end : < 4 s (hors décision humaine)
  📊 Confiance IA ≥ 85 % → suggestion "auto-approuvable"
  📊 Confiance IA 60–85 % → revue agent obligatoire
  📊 Confiance IA < 60 % → rejet auto + demande pièce supplémentaire
end note

@enduml
